						</tr><tr>
							<td id="article_byline">
								by <b>Richard Fisher</b> on <b>April  6, 2010</b>
							</td><td id="article_category">
								Categories: <b><a href="/category.php?id=352&category=3D HDTV">3D HDTV</a></b>, <b><a href="/category.php?id=501&category=DLP HDTVs">DLP HDTVs</a></b>
